{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/216a646d8429b4fd45489c93f9d1ef9a.poster.avif?t=1737073864\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/216a646d8429b4fd45489c93f9d1ef9a.webm?t=1737073864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/216a646d8429b4fd45489c93f9d1ef9a.mp4?t=1737073864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>RITE is a high-speed precision platformer where you must conquer a series of demanding trials, a rite of passage for every Nim.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/0dcda9c78d0954ead05388938dad27f0.poster.avif?t=1737073864\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/0dcda9c78d0954ead05388938dad27f0.webm?t=1737073864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/0dcda9c78d0954ead05388938dad27f0.mp4?t=1737073864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find the key and reach the exit to move on to the next trial, and maybe collect some gold along the way. Who knows, they could prove valuable to those who like a brutal challenge..<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/8ee3a03becc4d90c7b543c611be3631b.gif?t=1737073864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/8ee3a03becc4d90c7b543c611be3631b.poster.avif?t=1737073864\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>For fans of platformers old and new, RITE features 160 carefully crafted levels, fluid and responsive controls, lush pixel art, and an original soundtrack by Grand Prize Big Fuzz.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/967922e0b1253a253025579dd014ff79.gif?t=1737073864\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/extras/967922e0b1253a253025579dd014ff79.poster.avif?t=1737073864\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rite of the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/6f0a4beccd37f1bf372c01c3afbcf16e1dccdccc.jpg"},{"name":"Rite of the Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/de79fcc44aa879939a09d6e57c3893eed562fc80.jpg"},{"name":"Rite of the Tundra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/a3e04271fb4653a15d03fe1cccdc3485b26f27f3.jpg"},{"name":"Rite of the Mountain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/dcb15c925b3a1e6d6f136635f19ffaa75bf63627.jpg"},{"name":"Get rich and die tryin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/cb7e0cd8f96b3d4b8a4b670e0d5f0f9790f83090.jpg"},{"name":"Rite of the Gods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/cc5b1bde2b377c0c91af1accac15a577259753e4.jpg"},{"name":"Guess I shoulda made it harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1322650/cd7f6942b9da4caaad9808df443fff4be44ac6de.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1322650?t=1737073864","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1322650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737073864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st